  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>One vertex of a rectangular parallelopiped is at the origin&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math>&nbsp;and the lengths of its edges along&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;axes are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> units respectively,</p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;be the vertex <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math>,</p><p>Now plotting the diagram we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0115_3109dd10c03a.png\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 226px;\" /></p><p>Now equation of line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>And equation of line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now finding,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#215;</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#215;</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#215;</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now we know that,</p><p>Shortest Distance,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mover><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#215;</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#215;</mo><mover><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>"
